* Tue Nov 18 2025 Qinyun Tan <qinyuntan@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5.2_rc1%%DIST%%]
- anolis: mm: do not read rss_stat as percpu if percpu counter is not initialized (Zelin Deng)
- mm: remove unnecessary calls to lru_add_drain (Rik van Riel)
- mm: convert mm's rss stats to use atomic mode (ZhangPeng)
- percpu_counter: introduce atomic mode for percpu_counter (ZhangPeng)
- mm: swap: check for stable address space before operating on the VMA (Charan Teja Kalla)
- fork: only invoke khugepaged, ksm hooks if no error (Lorenzo Stoakes)
- mm/ksm: remove redundant code in ksm_fork (Jinjiang Tu)
- fork: use __mt_dup() to duplicate maple tree in dup_mmap() (Peng Zhang)
- maple_tree: preserve the tree attributes when destroying maple tree (Peng Zhang)
- maple_tree: introduce interfaces __mt_dup() and mtree_dup() (Peng Zhang)
- maple_tree: introduce {mtree,mas}_lock_nested() (Peng Zhang)
- maple_tree: add mt_free_one() and mt_attr() helpers (Peng Zhang)
- ext4: fix potential null deref in ext4_mb_init() (Baokun Li)
- ext4: implement linear-like traversal across order xarrays (Baokun Li)
- ext4: refactor choose group to scan group (Baokun Li)
- ext4: open coding repeated check in next_linear_group (Kemeng Shi)
- ext4: use correct criteria name instead stale integer number in comment (Kemeng Shi)
- ext4: remove unused parameter ngroup in ext4_mb_choose_next_group_*() (Kemeng Shi)
- ext4: convert free groups order lists to xarrays (Baokun Li)
- ext4: fix largest free orders lists corruption on mb_optimize_scan switch (Baokun Li)
- ext4: fix zombie groups in average fragment size lists (Baokun Li)
- ext4: factor out ext4_mb_scan_group() (Baokun Li)
- ext4: factor out ext4_mb_might_prefetch() (Baokun Li)
- ext4: keep "prefetch_grp" and "nr" consistent (Kemeng Shi)
- ext4: remove unused ext4_allocation_context::ac_groups_considered (Kemeng Shi)
- ext4: factor out __ext4_mb_scan_group() (Baokun Li)
- ext4: convert EXT4_B2C(sbi->s_stripe) users to EXT4_NUM_B2C (Ojaswin Mujoo)
- ext4: merge freed extent with existing extents before insertion (Baokun Li)
- ext4: convert sbi->s_mb_free_pending to atomic_t (Baokun Li)
- ext4: make running and commit transaction have their own freed_data_list (Jinke Han)
- ext4: fix typo in CR_GOAL_LEN_SLOW comment (Baokun Li)
- ext4: get rid of some obsolete EXT4_MB_HINT flags (Baokun Li)
- ext4: utilize multiple global goals to reduce contention (Baokun Li)
- ext4: remove unnecessary s_md_lock on update s_mb_last_group (Baokun Li)
- ext4: remove unnecessary s_mb_last_start (Baokun Li)
- ext4: separate stream goal hits from s_bal_goals for better tracking (Baokun Li)
- ext4: add ext4_try_lock_group() to skip busy groups (Baokun Li)
- fs: rearrange general fastpath check now that O_CREAT uses it (Christian Brauner)
- fs: remove audit dummy context check (Christian Brauner)
- fs: pull up trailing slashes check for O_CREAT (Christian Brauner)
- fs: move audit parent inode (Christian Brauner)
- fs: try an opportunistic lookup for O_CREAT opens too (Jeff Layton)
- fs/file.c: add fast path in find_next_fd() (Yu Ma)
- fs/file.c: conditionally clear full_fds (Yu Ma)
- fs/file.c: remove sanity_check and add likely/unlikely in alloc_fd() (Yu Ma)
- close_files(): don't bother with xchg() (Al Viro)

